	(bus_alias "Coil"
		(members "12V" "Signal" "GND")
	)
	(text "The original ignition harness often gets damaged by heat and age.  \n\nA replacement ignition coil harness is available as spare part:   \n\"Ignition overlay harness Part No: 1J0 971 658L\"\n\nI purchased an igntition harness via AliExpress.com.\nIt has a 12 pin Deutsch connector -- easy for disconnecting the ignition.\n\nCylinder #1 is closest to the cam belt, and has the longer cable, while \nthe shorter cable goes to cylinder #4 (flywheel end of the engine).  \n\nPicture of VAG ignition coil \"normal\" 165 mm length, \ncopied from maxxecu.com"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
